---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import EducationTitle from '../components/EducationTitle.astro';
import InstitutionLink from '../components/InstitutionLink.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="Background, research interests, and recent experience of Abdurakhmon Dadaboev.">
  <header class="page-header">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>About me</h1>
    <p class="profile-line">Computer Vision Engineer · Data-focused AI Researcher</p>
  </header>

  <section class="bio">
    <img src="/images/about-portrait-2026.jpg" width="1014" height="1280" alt="Abdurakhmon Dadaboev" />
    <div>
      <p>I started with art and technical automation before studying electronic engineering. Art trained me to notice shape and detail, while engineering taught me to understand how separate parts work together. Both still influence how I approach computer vision problems.</p>
      <p>I moved to South Korea independently and learned Korean from the beginning. Studying, interpreting, and representing Uzbek students taught me to ask clear questions, listen carefully, and work with people from different backgrounds.</p>
      <p>Today I work on road-image data, segmentation, image retrieval, and offline OCR. I begin by understanding the data and the people who will use the result, then build a process that can be tested and reviewed. I am comfortable entering unfamiliar areas, checking what I do not know, and continuing until the result is useful and dependable.</p>
      <div class="bio-links"><a href="/resume">View resume</a><a href="/research-and-projects">View projects</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h2>Research interests</h2>
    <div class="interest-grid">
      <div><h3>Computer vision</h3><p>Image segmentation, classification, retrieval, OCR, and knowledge distillation.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Data curation</h3><p>Collection rules, metadata filtering, duplicate analysis, labeling, and human review tools.</p></div>
      <div><h3>Practical systems</h3><p>Offline inference, memory limits, API workflows, reproducible evaluation, and structured outputs.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section">
    <h2>Experience and education</h2>
    <div class="timeline">
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Jul 2026 to present</div><div><div class="timeline-title">North American Road Data and Automatic Labeling</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Hyundai Motor Genesis Chassis Test Team · Vegas · Korea University</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Building a repeatable process to collect, find, and manually review useful road images.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Jul 2026</div><div><div class="timeline-title">AI Vision Research Intern</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Youngchang Labs</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Worked on road image dataset construction, analysis, and computer vision model development.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Feb 2026 to present</div><div><div class="timeline-title">Offline Exam OCR System</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Big Data Mining Lab · Korea University</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Building one local system that matches students, reads answers, and stores results without sending data outside.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Mar to Dec 2025</div><div><div class="timeline-title">Road Damage Detection Research</div><div class="timeline-subtitle">Crowdsourced Mobility Support · R2320973</div><div class="timeline-content"><p>Improved how irregular cracks were labeled and built a system that passed independent performance testing.</p></div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">2024 to Aug 2026</div><div><div class="timeline-title"><EducationTitle institution="korea-university">M.S. Big Data Science</EducationTitle></div><div class="timeline-subtitle"><InstitutionLink href="https://bigdatascience.korea.ac.kr/">Korea University, Sejong</InstitutionLink> · GPA 4.46/4.5</div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">2019 to 2023</div><div><div class="timeline-title"><EducationTitle institution="sun-moon-university">B.S. Electronic Engineering</EducationTitle></div><div class="timeline-subtitle"><InstitutionLink href="https://electric.sunmoon.ac.kr/">Sun Moon University</InstitutionLink> · GPA 4.18/4.5</div></div></div>
      <div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-meta">Sep 2017 to Dec 2018</div><div><div class="timeline-title"><EducationTitle institution="sun-moon-language-institute">Korean Language Program</EducationTitle></div><div class="timeline-subtitle"><InstitutionLink href="https://kli.sunmoon.ac.kr/new_en/web/page1-1.asp">Sun Moon University Korean Language Institute</InstitutionLink> · Completed the highest-level class (Level 7) · TOPIK Level 6</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-section details">
    <div><h2>Tools</h2><p>Python, PyTorch, OpenCV, Ultralytics YOLO, DINOv3, FAISS, SQLite, Git, and Jupyter.</p></div>
    <div><h2>Languages</h2><p>Uzbek (native), Korean (TOPIK Level 6), English, and Russian.</p></div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-header { max-width: 48rem; padding-bottom: 2rem; }
    .profile-line { margin-top: 0.65rem; color: var(--accent); font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 650; }
    .bio { display: grid; grid-template-columns: clamp(14rem, 21vw, 18rem) minmax(0, 1fr); align-items: start; gap: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.5rem); padding: clamp(1.4rem, 4vw, 2.2rem); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .bio img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; margin: 0; border-radius: var(--radius-md); }
    .bio p { margin-bottom: 0.8rem; font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.78; }
    .bio-links { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1rem; }
    .bio-links a { color: var(--accent); font-size: 0.94rem; font-weight: 600; }
    .about-section { padding-block: clamp(3.5rem, 8vw, 5rem); }
    .about-section > h2 { margin-bottom: 1.4rem; }
    .interest-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .interest-grid > div { padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .interest-grid h3 { margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .interest-grid p { font-size: 0.97rem; }
    .about-section .timeline { display: grid; gap: 0.8rem; border-top: 0; }
    .about-section .timeline-item { padding: 1.25rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .details { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1rem; }
    .details > div { padding: 1.4rem; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface); box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .details h2 { margin-bottom: 0.45rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .details p { font-size: 0.97rem; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) { .bio { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .bio img { width: min(100%, 20rem); } .interest-grid, .details { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  </style>
</Layout>
